    <h2>Education & distinctions</h2>
    <p>Informatics, Luong Van Tuy Gifted High School (2025–2028 expected). At the annual provincial Informatics Excellent Student Competition, which also selects the VOI team, I received a Consolation Prize in September 2025 and a First Prize in September 2026. Other distinctions include participation in the Vietnam IOAI National Selection Test, regional informatics olympiad medals and ICPC Vietnam National Honorable Mention.</p>
